    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29958" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγγελ-άω</span></b> , fut. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άσομαι [ᾰ</span>], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>laugh at, mock</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς ποιουμένοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					277
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				1355
			</span></i>; in tmesi, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γέλωτ᾽ ἐν σοὶ γελῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					551
				</span></i>
			 codd.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατά τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>OC</u>
					1339
				</span></i>
			: without dat. expressed, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>El.</u>
				807
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				1362
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴς τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herod.
					1.77
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Ind.</u>
				15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>laugh in</i> or <i>among</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὔρα ἐγγελῶσα κύμασιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sosicr.
					2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
